    "en": [
      "Vintage sepia postcard showing the entrance and façade of a modernist-style hotel building partly hidden among tall trees. A low white wall and central gate lead to a path up to the hotel, with lampposts near the doorway. Printed captions in Greek and English identify the place as the Diana Hotel in Ekali, and publisher details appear in Greek along the bottom."
